で心優しい性格。上に兄・下に妹がいます。さくらんぼが好物です。\n\"死\"に関係している妖怪のイメージなので、大きくて赤い鎌を持っています。\n\n◤資料◢\n￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣\n✦清美のツイートまとめ(min.t)：\nhttps://min.togetter.com/zAhuxRC\n\n✧創作りんねいろ設定(pixiv)：\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/52016286\n\n￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣\n\n何卒ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yukitea017/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 978971, "client_id": 2614089, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8bf0bea664ac71c1d70195294698a14f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8bf0bea664ac71c1d70195294698a14f, https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9666c7c2ac531e0b4ec2585d31e6a01c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=730d5f808e26931205b223c38c7f1716 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d6970dcec008537c96a036a7b5529f36", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d6970dcec008537c96a036a7b5529f36, https://si.imgix.net/8bf9458d/uploads/origins/1470cd20-7a86-4275-8162-d741caadc3fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=